Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy,...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.18,0:01:57.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...Enel şimdiye dek Altın Çan'ı almış olmalı.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.73,0:02:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman geri almak zorundayım!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.77,0:02:05.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunu ödünç alıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.83,0:02:24.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cennetin Kapısı bile bir anda yok olup gitti.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.92,0:02:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Melek Adası'nın yok olduğuna inanamıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.42,0:02:30.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi ne yapacağız?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.05,0:02:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdilik Bulut Sonu'na gidelim ve Mavi Deniz'e kaçalım.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.80,0:02:35.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Başka seçeneğimiz yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.05,0:02:39.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama Beyaz-Beyaz Denizi'nde hâlâ çok fazla insan var!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapabiliriz ki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.56,0:02:45.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sütlü yol olmadan, gemileri Beyaz Deniz'e nasıl indirebiliriz?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onları öylece bırakacak mıyız?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok geçmeden burası da yok olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.63,0:03:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beyaz-Beyaz Denizi...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Skypiea yok oluyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek bu o...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harikulade!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.87,0:03:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Efsanevi şehir Shandora’nın gururu olan büyük çan kulesi!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.37,0:03:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mükemmel!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.88,0:03:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten bana, kudretli tanrıya layık.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.34,0:03:58.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu topraklarda 400 yıllık mücadelenin başladığını ilan eden çan...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.09,0:04:02.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dikkat edin!\NYine bir şey düşüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.43,0:04:03.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi ne...?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.35,0:04:04.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İki seksen uzanın!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.02,0:04:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaprak...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.20,0:04:19.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Üzerine bir şey yazılmış.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.95,0:04:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu bir mesaj!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy ve Nami'den!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yazıyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.79,0:04:30.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Bu devasa sarmaşığı batıya doğru devirin."
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peki... bu ne işe yarayacak ki?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.77,0:04:55.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amaçlarıma ulaştım!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geriye kalan tek şey,...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.45,0:05:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bu toprakları ve imparator kömülüs bulutlarını *Raigo'mla yok etmek...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.33,0:05:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...ve Sonsuz Vearth'e doğru yola çıkmak.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.58,0:05:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neredeyse gidişini göreceğime üzülüyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.63,0:05:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enel!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şeytan!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.22,0:05:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Deminkinden bile büyük!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.89,0:05:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu adadan...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...zamanında kaçmamız mümkün değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elveda, Skypiea!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sonuncudan daha büyük! Pislik herif!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haklısın.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.12,0:05:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın çanı aldığı için...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...artık bu ülkeye ihtiyacı yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, kaçmayacak mısın?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şimdi kaçmamı mı bekliyorsun?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın çanı çalmak istiyorsun, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet! Çalacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.97,0:06:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Açıkçası... waver'ı bile kullanamıyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.60,0:06:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Gidersem, sadece boşa zıplayacaksın,\No yüzden seni oraya fırlatmama izin ver.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.15,0:06:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.28,0:06:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalacağıma söz ver!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.37,0:06:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, o iş bende! \NYapalım şunu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.92,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Herkes hâlâ aşağıda!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.92,0:06:37.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece bir anlık şansımız var, \Nbir kez yapabiliriz.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.50,0:06:42.63,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Umarım diğerleri mesajı almıştır.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.34,0:06:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarmaşık düşerken rampa gibi kullanarak gemiye mi atlayacaklar?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Başka ne anlama gelebilir ki?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu çılgınlık...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.39,0:06:55.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam öyleyse gidip onları durdur.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.85,0:06:57.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Durdurabilir miyim sanki?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.27,0:07:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Öyle ya da böyle, çılgınca veya değil,\Nelimizdeki tek şans bu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.53,0:07:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uzun Burun-kun!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam, yakaladım!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.41,0:07:13.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burada kalırsak, harabelere düşeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarmaşıktan uzaklaşın!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sağlam zemine kaçın!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu bana bağlı!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.75,0:07:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemiye doğru kes, değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.63,0:07:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Hey...!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.22,0:07:29.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Bu gökyüzü adasında, o şey düşmeden önce\N Enel'e ulaşabilecek tek kişiler...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.85,0:07:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...sadece onlar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Artık ne savaşmak ne de kaçmak işinize yarayacak.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hala anlamadınız mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.99,0:07:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalma oyununa dahil olduğunuz an, kaderiniz belirlenmişti.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-B-B-Başaracak mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana güveniyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.41,0:08:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu kesebilecek olan sadece sensin!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.96,0:08:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tüm bu delikleri açmayı bırak, lanet olası!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın! Kesti!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Değersiz böcekler!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.21,0:08:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.09,0:08:46.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-A-A-Ama başardı! Kesti!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Olamaz...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.59,0:08:49.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.18,0:08:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düşmüyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama kesmişti!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.43,0:08:59.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar da güçlü bir sarmaşık!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gerçek bir bitki olduğundan emin miyiz?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar acınası...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.11,0:09:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siz yabancılar işimize\Nburnunuzu sokup duruyorsunuz.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper, yapma!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sessiz ol!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.65,0:09:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çan, Kalgara'nın arzusunu taşıyor\Nve onu çalma hakkı bizimdir!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'nın onu\Nçalmak için ne sebebi var?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boşver onu, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.16,0:09:25.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yolumuza çıkamayacak kadar yaralı!\NO sarmaşığı devirmeye odaklanmalıyız!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy ve Nami bize güveniyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.55,0:09:31.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro çoktan bizim için yarısını kesti.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.34,0:09:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bütün şey birazcık\Neğilmeye başlamış olmalı.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.14,0:09:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kayaku Boshi Dansı'mın\Nölümcül patlamalarıyla...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.97,0:09:42.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...o şey yere çarparken feryat edecek!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.94,0:09:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her zamanki gibi, takımı bir üst tura çıkarmak bana düştü.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.44,0:09:53.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robin, düşen yoldaşlarımızla ilgilen!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kashiwa-mochi*{\i0} gibi görünüyorlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam yol ileri!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.04,0:10:10.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dört yüz yıl önce, bir kaşif, Altın Şehir olduğuna dair yalan söyledi.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.59,0:10:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alay konusu olmasına rağmen, torunları onun sözlerine inandılar...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.39,0:10:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...ve hala Mavi Deniz'de Altın Şehir'i arıyorlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.82,0:10:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın çanı çalmak...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.82,0:10:37.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...onlara Altın Şehir'in gökte olduğunu söyleyecek.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hasır şapkalı çocuk, bu inancı taşıyor işte...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kayaku Boshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.91,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Patlayan Yıldız!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Daha iyi bir neden olabilir mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte bu romantizm.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir durumda bile...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...kaçma şansını kaybedecek kadar ileri gidiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.05,0:10:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Epey çılgın!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hissatsu Kayaku Boshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.47,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ölümcül Patlayan Yıldız
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kayaku Boshi Boshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.47,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Patlayan Yıldız Yıldız
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.47,0:11:00.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Wagomu!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.47,0:11:00.89,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp'un Ölümcül Lastik Bandı
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.89,0:11:02.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rolling Kayaku Boshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.89,0:11:02.27,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Dönen Patlayan Yıldız
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kayaku Boshi!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.27,0:11:03.39,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Patlayan Yıldız
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.61,0:11:16.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bu kaşifin torununun adını söyle.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mont Blanc Cricket.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.12,0:11:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,400 yıl önceki atası,...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...atasının adı...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.63,0:11:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...Noland mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.59,0:11:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor, Wyper?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.72,0:11:43.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu bir mucize mi,...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,...Büyük Savaşçı Kalgara?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekala,...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...göğün bitimine kadar\Nhaykırma zamanı, Nola!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.90,0:12:01.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sesini duymaktan hoşlandığın çanı çalacağız ki Noland onu duyabilsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.03,0:12:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.78,0:12:43.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ama darbenin sarmaşığı hiç hareket ettirmemesi saçmalık...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu sefer art arda üç vuruş-
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.41,0:12:46.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çekil.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Reject!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.05,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ret
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.69,0:13:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da neydi öyle?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.81,0:13:13.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.03,0:13:16.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aptal...!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.90,0:13:19.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ret kadranı kullandı...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.24,0:13:24.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Devril artık, Dev Jack!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.96,0:13:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düşüyor!!!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Başlıyoruz! Atla, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.22,0:13:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Elinden geleni yap!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.89,0:13:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aslında...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.68,0:13:54.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bu jet kadranının tam gücünü hiç denemedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.06,0:13:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çünkü o kadar güçlü ki ben bile tam olarak kontrol edemiyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Benim için sorun değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.65,0:14:01.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşte gidiyoruz, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düşüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.13,0:14:20.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Orada neler oluyor, öyle?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.17,0:14:24.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Size güveniyoruz, Luffy! Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.43,0:14:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer gökyüzü adası şimdi yok olursa, altın çanı çalamayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çalacaksın, değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cricket amcanın duymasını sağlayacaksın, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enel'in gemisine atlamalısın!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.11,0:14:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her şey size bağlı!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gidin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.37,0:14:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.17,0:15:00.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye Raigo'mun tamamlanmasını bekleyemiyorlar?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.88,0:15:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar sabırsızlar...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.63,0:15:07.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O zaman başka seçeneğim yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.89,0:15:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bana ulaşmaya çalışmak tam anlamıyla küstahlıktır!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir dersi hakediyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mamaragan*!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.74,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yoğun Yıldırım
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Piç kurusu!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.17,0:15:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarmaşığın dibini yok ederek onu çökertmeye çalışıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir şey yap, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmam gerekiyor?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.05,0:15:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zaten tırmanıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.22,0:15:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eğer sarmaşığın temelini yok ederse, yeterince yükseğe çıkamayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enel'in gerisinde kalacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yıldırımlar tamamen Yüksek Bahçe'yi vuruyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yıldırımım seni etkilemese bile,...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.49,0:16:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bana dokunamadığın sürece\Nhiçbir şey ifade etmez!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.91,0:16:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Düş ve Raigo'mun tamamlanmasını bekle, lastik adam!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.01,0:16:31.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yüksek Bahçe... toz haline getiriliyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.10,0:16:37.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.02,0:16:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.77,0:16:46.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Senden uzak durmaya gerçekten niyetli, ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.69,0:16:49.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak denesin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.70,0:16:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harabeler açığa çıkıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.16,0:17:01.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zemini un ufak etmeye niyetli.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper aşağıda yerde yatıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro da!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.88,0:17:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Harabeler...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramayacak, Enel!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.57,0:17:27.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandora'da yaşamış...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.99,0:17:35.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...onurlu savaşçıların tarihini yok edemezsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.46,0:17:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nerede olursa olsun, bu büyük güç, \Nyaratabilir ve besleyebilir...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.25,0:17:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Onu yıkmak o kadar da \Nkolay bir iş değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.55,0:17:54.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar orman yakarsan yak,...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.47,0:17:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...ne kadar harabe yıkarsan yık,...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.65,0:18:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...toprak kaybetmeyecek!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaç, Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.58,0:18:18.45,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Çok tehlikeli!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper ölecek!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bırak beni, seni aptal!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.41,0:18:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.17,0:18:26.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hala küçük aptalların\Nkoşuşturmasını duyuyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.58,0:19:07.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Vearth...? Tabii ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.01,0:19:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Batmıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.39,0:19:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yüksek Bahçe hala dayanıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne muazzam bir güç.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.57,0:19:34.28,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Elbette...!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.28,0:19:37.28,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Vearth son derece muhteşemdir!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.78,0:19:45.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Asla uğruna savaşılacak bir şey değildi...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.04,0:19:50.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}...ama yine de çok fazla kan döküldü \Nve çok fazla hayat kaybedildi.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.04,0:19:55.30,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Niye bunu geçtiğimiz 400 yılda fark edemedik?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.34,0:19:59.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çekilin! Sarmaşık düşüyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu tarafa gelin, hemen!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.11,0:20:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Git...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.49,0:20:25.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Git, Hasır Şapka!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.04,0:20:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geliyorum, Enel!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her birinin küstahlığı...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.63,0:20:39.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın çanı geri ver!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu iş fazla uzadı!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sabrımı yitirdim!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bence yeterince büyüdü...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Toprakla birlikte yok olun!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.86,0:20:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Raigo!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, sağol.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.96,0:21:16.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çabalarının boşa gitmesine izin vermeyeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.22,0:21:23.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bekle, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gemi o tarafta!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.48,0:21:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, orası olmaz! Onun içinde hava türbülansı ve yıldırım var!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.53,0:21:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sana bile ne olacağını tahmin etmek mümkün değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.24,0:21:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu muazzam güç karşısında ne yapabilirsin, lastik adam?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.69,0:22:17.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.69,0:22:17.94,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.94,0:22:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ha{\alpha&HFF&}nabi!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.94,0:22:25.32,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ha{\alpha&HFF&}vaifişek
Dialogue: 51,0:22:19.65,0:22:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\alpha&HFF&}Ha{\alpha&H00&}na{\alpha&HFF&}bi!
Dialogue: 51,0:22:19.65,0:22:25.32,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\alpha&HFF&}Ha{\alpha&H00&}vai{\alpha&HFF&}fişek
Dialogue: 52,0:22:21.95,0:22:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\alpha&HFF&}Hana{\alpha&H00&}bi!
Dialogue: 52,0:22:21.95,0:22:25.32,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\alpha&HFF&}Havai{\alpha&H00&}fişek
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.32,0:22:27.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ogon Botan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.32,0:22:27.45,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Altın Şakayık
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.88,0:22:47.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Gökyüzü adasının havası, senin aptalca \Nyıldırımlarınla bozulana kadar çok güzeldi!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yıldırım manyağı!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.27,0:22:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu elektrik boşalması da neyin nesi?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doğru ya...!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.11,0:23:03.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolundaki altın, elektrik için mükemmel bir iletken!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.16,0:23:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pekala! Bütün elektrik boşalmadan önce onu düşüreceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.41,0:23:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her şeyi yok et!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.46,0:23:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Albay McKinley!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.13,0:23:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen, durun!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.42,0:23:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burası tanrının bölgesi!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.26,0:23:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu çok anlamsız!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.38,0:23:25.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir anlamı olması gerekmez!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.26,0:23:30.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yaşam ve ölüm arasında kalan insanlar başka ne yapabilir ki?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.18,0:23:34.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Yurdumuzu terkedip, yaşamayı seçtik.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.81,0:23:39.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Dönecek ve gidecek hiçbir yerimiz yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.07,0:23:44.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Tüm yapabileceğimiz dua etmek.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.90,0:23:54.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}O yüzden efsane der ki  "adanın şarkısı"nı \Nbir kez daha duyduğumuzda savaş bitecek.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.08,0:24:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu durumda hayatta kalan biri olacak mı...?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.21,0:24:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enel'e karşı duracak cesaretim olsaydı,...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.09,0:24:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...acaba onları dahil etmek zorunda kalır mıydım?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.26,0:24:13.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Söyle, Suu...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.43,0:24:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sence Tanrı var mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.56,0:24:22.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Varsa, sence bizi kurtaracak mı...?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.24,0:24:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen... eğer gerçekten varsanız...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.57,0:24:32.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...onları koruyun, Tanrı'm!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.41,0:24:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen... bir mucize gerçekleştirin!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.62,0:24:39.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lütfen, Tanrı'm, bu ülkeyi koruyun!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.76,0:24:54.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Açıl gökyüzü!!!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.49,0:25:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fırtına bulutu yığını yok oldu!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.41,0:25:18.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu öyle?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.42,0:25:22.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tam isabet, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.94,0:25:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çal onu, Hasır Şapka!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.32,0:25:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandora'nın Ateşini Yak!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.37,0:25:57.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yap şunu, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.49,0:26:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adanın şarkısını duymamızı sağla!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.12,0:26:08.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Raigo'mu nasıl yok edersin, seni lanet olası Mavi Deniz maymunu?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.17,0:26:11.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geliyorum, onun yanı sıra seni de çalacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.51,0:26:14.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seni küstah alçak!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.06,0:26:19.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}200.000.000
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.06,0:26:19.27,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}200 Milyon
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.93,0:26:21.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Volt:
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.93,0:26:21.94,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Voltluk:
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.39,0:26:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Amaru!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.39,0:26:24.94,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yıldırım Tanrısı
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.40,0:26:28.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O da ne öyle?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.73,0:26:30.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neyi çalacaksın?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.65,0:26:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın çanı mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.95,0:26:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir kez daha çaldığında,\Nsavaşın bitişinin işareti olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.53,0:26:41.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu kehaneti gerçekleştirmeye mi \Nçalışıyorsun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.75,0:26:43.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ben tanrıyım!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.55,0:26:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sen sadece tek bir paramecia türüsün!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.47,0:27:01.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Logia gücümle seni ezmememin imkanı yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.10,0:27:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunun bende işe yaramayacağını söylemiştim!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.02,0:27:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu "Ben Tanrıyım" saçmalığından bıktım!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.73,0:27:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiçbir şeyi kurtarmayan tanrı mı olur?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.58,0:27:26.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.71,0:27:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Şişlenmemek için mi tuttun onu?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.84,0:27:31.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.88,0:27:37.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sıradaki hamlen ne, lastik adam?!\NKaçacak yerin yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.18,0:27:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kolun tarafından aşağı çekileceksin\Nve mızrak daha derinlere saplanacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.22,0:27:46.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ve bundan kaçınmak düşmene sebep olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.61,0:27:52.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar gelerek iyi iş çıkardın!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.03,0:27:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancak, burası sınırın ve öteye gidemezsin!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.91,0:27:58.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bir Raigo daha yapacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.95,0:28:05.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Vatandaşlar olarak buna zorunluyuz...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.42,0:28:13.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.42,0:28:17.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Gökyüzü Adası\Ngerçekten yok mu edilecek?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.47,0:28:26.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Demek düşmeyi seçtin!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.44,0:28:34.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.19,0:28:38.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Yolumdan çekil!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.49,0:28:44.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-Ne yapı...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.25,0:28:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Beni küçümseme, kulak memesi!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.08,0:28:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.08,0:28:52.54,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik Roket
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.00,0:28:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.00,0:28:57.92,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.88,0:29:01.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yine mi aynı saldırı?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.80,0:29:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çan çalana dek!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.47,0:29:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bu sefer kesinlikle şişleneceksin!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.64,0:29:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Ogon Rifle!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.64,0:29:09.73,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Altın Tüfek
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.73,0:29:14.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Çık hızlı!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.08,0:29:35.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Jaya'ya döndüğün zaman...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.30,0:29:39.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...bizi gitmiş görünce ne düşüneceksin?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.76,0:29:44.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sadece biraz daha bekle!\NBir mesaj göndereceğim...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.76,0:29:48.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1020)}..."Biz buradayız!" diye.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.86,0:29:57.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandora'nın Ateşini Yakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.49,0:30:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gökyüzündeki savaş başlayalı \N400 yıl oldu.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.24,0:30:09.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İstediğimiz tek şey, bir defa daha...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.62,0:30:13.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,978)}Evet. Kutsal topraklar...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.79,0:30:19.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...bir kez daha şarkı söyleyecek...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.26,0:30:27.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...bir gün, eminim.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.94,0:30:45.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}6 yıl önce, Grand Line'daki Jaya Adası’nda \Ndevasa bir Altın Şehir gördüm!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.37,0:30:53.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın Şehir gerçekten var!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.59,0:31:08.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hiç kimse Altın Şehir'in veya gökyüzü \Nadasının varlığını kanıtlayamadı.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.26,0:31:12.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,267)}İşte romantizm budur!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.02,0:31:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Çal!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.65,0:31:17.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,İhtiyar!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.15,0:31:19.40,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Duyabiliyor musun?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.65,0:31:22.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Altın Şehir burada!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.78,0:31:26.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,400 yıldır...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.91,0:31:28.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,...Altın Şehir...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.20,0:31:37.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,...gökyüzündeydi!!!
